    {
      "id": "2086590006898958752",
      "text": "Fable one-shotted a Rust rewrite of the TerminalTextEffects Python library in 11M tokens. Startup time went from 87ms to 2ms and rendering speed is up by 9.6x. Now zero dependencies and a 3mb single exec 🤯 https://t.co/3cTEQAqYdO",
      "createdAt": "Sun Aug 09 23:06:39 +0000 2026",
      "viewCount": 45438,
